0.25 0.11 (then decide whether to accept the request or not. Files can thus decide on their own) 124.72 217.49 B
0.25 0.3 (who should be allowed to operate on it, and also which programs that should be) 124.72 205.49 B
0.25 0.05 (allowed to access the file. The role of the file system manager is by this reduced to a) 124.72 193.49 B
0.25 0.03 (simple interface to load the file agents from the disk device driver. A default caching) 124.72 181.49 B
0.25 0.19 (mechanism can be added, but the files should have an option to manage their own) 124.72 169.49 B
0.25 0.09 (caching strategy. This will enable databases to have their own caching mechanisms,) 124.72 157.49 B
0 0 0 1 0 0 0 K
